  "summary": "Obfuscated postinstall script with child_process + HTTP POST in @fleetbo/svro",
  "details": "The package ships heavily obfuscated JavaScript in dist/postinstall.cjs and dist/cli.cjs (hex-mangled identifiers such as _0x75053a, _0x4ab71a, _0x47cfc4). The corresponding dist/postinstall.js and dist/cli.js require Node's child_process module and issue HTTP POST requests. postinstall.cjs runs automatically on npm install, combining obfuscation, local command execution capability, and outbound POST traffic in the install lifecycle path. Obfuscation of install-time code hides the destination and payload from inspection and is not consistent with a legitimately documented install-time behavior.",
